Package: coo
Type: Package
Title: Pigeon-Inspired Discrete and Continuous Colour Scales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("A.", "Steen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "asteen@example.com")
    )
Author: A. Steen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: A. Steen <asteen@example.com>
Description: Provides pigeon-inspired colour palettes, direct mapping of data
    to colours, and colour and fill scales for 'ggplot2'. Discrete data use
    nested palettes of up to seven colours. Continuous data use a smooth
    teal-to-violet ramp with a feather-gray or wing-charcoal centre and
    configurable limits and midpoint.
