Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    scales (>= 1.3.0),
    stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
